## 2. Key Remediation Changes

### Security
1. **Cryptographically Secure Random Generation**:
   - In [services.py](file:///c:/Users/win%2010/Aurexion_technologies/src/apps/recruitment/services.py), replaced `random.choices` with `secrets.choice` for candidate tracking code generation (`AUR-APP-XXXX`).
   - In [Users/index.tsx](file:///c:/Users/win%2010/Aurexion_technologies/frontend/src/features/administration/pages/Users/index.tsx) and [sidebar.tsx](file:///c:/Users/win%2010/Aurexion_technologies/frontend/src/components/ui/sidebar.tsx), replaced `Math.random()` with `window.crypto.getRandomValues()`.
2. **Reverse Tabnabbing Prevention**:
   - Added `rel="noopener noreferrer"` across all `<a target="_blank">` external, resume, map, and document links in [Footer.tsx](file:///c:/Users/win%2010/Aurexion_technologies/frontend/src/features/public/components/Footer.tsx), [LeadershipSection.tsx](file:///c:/Users/win%2010/Aurexion_technologies/frontend/src/features/public/pages/About/components/LeadershipSection.tsx), [Applications/index.tsx](file:///c:/Users/win%2010/Aurexion_technologies/frontend/src/features/recruitment/pages/Applications/index.tsx), [Candidates/index.tsx](file:///c:/Users/win%2010/Aurexion_technologies/frontend/src/features/recruitment/pages/Candidates/index.tsx), [Documents/index.tsx](file:///c:/Users/win%2010/Aurexion_technologies/frontend/src/features/portal/pages/Documents/index.tsx), [LeadDetail.tsx](file:///c:/Users/win%2010/Aurexion_technologies/frontend/src/features/crm/pages/Leads/LeadDetail.tsx), and [Companies/index.tsx](file:///c:/Users/win%2010/Aurexion_technologies/frontend/src/features/crm/pages/Companies/index.tsx).
3. **Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Prevention**:
   - In [chart.tsx](file:///c:/Users/win%2010/Aurexion_technologies/frontend/src/components/ui/chart.tsx), removed `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` and replaced it with direct, safe React 19 `<style>{cssContent}</style>` rendering.
4. **Environment File Cleanliness**:
   - In [.env.example](file:///c:/Users/win%2010/Aurexion_technologies/.env.example), removed leftover merge conflict markers.

### Reliability
1. **Silent Exception Handling**:
   - In [audit.py](file:///c:/Users/win%2010/Aurexion_technologies/src/apps/authentication/audit.py) and [storage.py](file:///c:/Users/win%2010/Aurexion_technologies/src/apps/recruitment/storage.py), replaced empty `except: pass` with structured `logger.debug` logging.
   - In [support_performance_test.py](file:///c:/Users/win%2010/Aurexion_technologies/tests/support_performance_test.py), cleaned up query timing conversion error handling.
2. **Test Runner & Cache Reliability**:
   - In [settings.py](file:///c:/Users/win%2010/Aurexion_technologies/src/config/settings.py), enhanced `IS_TESTING` detection to support pytest as well as manage.py test.

### Duplication & Components
1. **Shared UI Components**:
   - Created [SearchInput.tsx](file:///c:/Users/win%2010/Aurexion_technologies/frontend/src/components/common/SearchInput.tsx) for search bar deduplication across data tables.
   - Created [StatusAlert.tsx](file:///c:/Users/win%2010/Aurexion_technologies/frontend/src/components/common/StatusAlert.tsx) for status banner deduplication across CMS & BDM forms.

